### Spread AI — Internal API (VS Code «REST Client» أو JetBrains HTTP Client)
### غيّر @base و @token — والطلبات لازم تطلع من IP مسموح (INTERNAL_API_IPS)

@base = https://ai.spreadagency.net/internal-api/v1/index.php
@token = PASTE_INTERNAL_API_TOKEN

### الحالة
GET {{base}}?r=health
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### أرقام امبارح مقارنة باليوم اللي قبله
GET {{base}}?r=metrics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### أرقام فترة
GET {{base}}?r=metrics&date_from=2026-10-14&date_to=2026-10-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### منشورات مش متقيّمة (👎 الأول)
GET {{base}}?r=posts&unevaluated_only=1&rating=down&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### منشور كامل
GET {{base}}?r=post&post_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### صورة تصميم (المسار من post → designs[].image)
GET {{base}}?r=media&path=uploads/designs/FILE.png
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### هوية البراند
GET {{base}}?r=brand&brand_id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### البرومبتات + أرقام كل إصدار
GET {{base}}?r=prompt_templates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### A/B لنوع برومبت
GET {{base}}?r=ab_results&template_key=campaign_content
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### البلاغات الجديدة
GET {{base}}?r=issues&status=new
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### أخطاء التوليد
GET {{base}}?r=ai_errors&date=2026-10-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### سجلات الأمان
GET {{base}}?r=security_logs&date=2026-10-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### الاقتراحات (ومعاها المرفوض)
GET {{base}}?r=change_requests&status=rejected
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test

### حفظ تقييم (ai_write)
POST {{base}}?r=save_evaluation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: ai_write
X-Client: test
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": 1,
  "content_scores": {"hook": 7, "clarity": 8, "brand_voice_match": 8, "relevance_to_services": 9, "cta": 6, "dialect_correctness": 9, "originality": 6, "platform_fit": 8},
  "design_scores": {"brand_colors_match": 8, "text_legibility": 7, "arabic_text_correctness": 5, "composition": 7, "idea_match": 8, "watermark_placement": 9},
  "strengths": "الهوك مصري وطبيعي",
  "weaknesses": "النص العربي في التصميم فيه حروف مكسورة",
  "fix_suggestion": "اكتب العنوان كطبقة نص بدل ما الموديل يرسمه"
}

### تحليل بلاغ (ai_write)
POST {{base}}?r=analyze_issue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: ai_write
X-Client: test
Content-Type: application/json

{"issue_id": 1, "ai_category": "design_quality", "ai_severity": "high", "root_cause": "…", "fix": "…", "related_issue_ids": []}

### حفظ التقرير اليومي (ai_write)
POST {{base}}?r=save_report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: ai_write
X-Client: test
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "daily", "report_date": "2026-10-21", "summary": "…", "payload": {"worst": [], "best": []}}

### اقتراح تعديل (draft — مستني موافقة الأدمن)
POST {{base}}?r=propose_change
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: draft
X-Client: test
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "prompt", "target": "campaign_content", "diff": "…", "reason": "…", "evidence": {"posts": [1, 2]}, "expected_impact": "…", "priority": "medium"}

### مسودة برومبت (draft)
POST {{base}}?r=draft_prompt
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: draft
X-Client: test
Content-Type: application/json

{"template_key": "campaign_content", "body": "البرومبت كامل…", "reason": "…"}

### مسودة رد على بلاغ (draft)
POST {{base}}?r=draft_reply
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: draft
X-Client: test
Content-Type: application/json

{"issue_id": 1, "body": "أهلاً بيك…", "channel": "inbox"}

### ⛔ لازم يترفض: صلاحية مش مطابقة
POST {{base}}?r=save_report
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Scope: read
X-Client: test
